# Git / GitHub Identity

For ALL git and GitHub work in this repository, use only this identity:

- GitHub account / profile: **`johnbekele`** (owner of `johnbekele/pokojowo-web-project`).
  - Authenticate pushes/PRs via the `gh` CLI account `johnbekele`.
  - If a push is denied for another account (e.g. a keyring credential like
    `Johnbekele6130893`), run `gh auth setup-git` so git uses the `johnbekele` token.
